{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45555","headline":"阳春曲 · 贯休","name":"阳春曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲口莫学阮嗣宗，不言是非非至公。\n爲手须似朱云辈，折槛英风至今在。\n男儿结发事君亲，须斅前贤多慷慨。\n历数雍熙房与杜，魏公姚公宋开府。\n尽向天上仙宫闲处坐，何不却辞上帝下下土？\n忍见苍生苦苦苦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}